{"4635560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FEED IT", "steam_appid": 4635560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635560/extras/9451981084387c2a50765be34a1acaee.poster.avif?t=1785681581\" width=1070 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635560/extras/9451981084387c2a50765be34a1acaee.webm?t=1785681581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Fire Is Safety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The woods are quiet until they are not. Every night, you leave the campfire to search for wood. The fire is the only thing keeping the monsters away, but it will not burn forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go too far, stay too long, or return too late, and they will find you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635560/extras/bc1147f40471c7a5dd2f1180fe58bb89.poster.avif?t=1785681581\" width=1070 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635560/extras/bc1147f40471c7a5dd2f1180fe58bb89.webm?t=1785681581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635560/extras/bc1147f40471c7a5dd2f1180fe58bb89.mp4?t=1785681581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do What You Must</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You goal is simple. Find enough wood. Bring it back. Feed the campfire. Survive until you can sleep. When the campfire is full, you are safe for the night and you can rest. If the fire dies before then, you are not. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635560/extras/c0e1fba5dfc58f63bd1b2c415aa0e74b.poster.avif?t=1785681581\" width=1078 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635560/extras/c0e1fba5dfc58f63bd1b2c415aa0e74b.webm?t=1785681581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635560/extras/c0e1fba5dfc58f63bd1b2c415aa0e74b.mp4?t=1785681581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't Panic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is moving between the trees. You may hear it before you see it. You may see it too late. You may think you have enough time for one more log.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You probably do not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635560/extras/9451981084387c2a50765be34a1acaee.poster.avif?t=1785681581\" width=1070 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635560/extras/9451981084387c2a50765be34a1acaee.webm?t=1785681581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Fire Is Safety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The woods are quiet until they are not. Every night, you leave the campfire to search for wood. The fire is the only thing keeping the monsters away, but it will not burn forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go too far, stay too long, or return too late, and they will find you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635560/extras/bc1147f40471c7a5dd2f1180fe58bb89.poster.avif?t=1785681581\" width=1070 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635560/extras/bc1147f40471c7a5dd2f1180fe58bb89.webm?t=1785681581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635560/extras/bc1147f40471c7a5dd2f1180fe58bb89.mp4?t=1785681581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do What You Must</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You goal is simple. Find enough wood. Bring it back. Feed the campfire. Survive until you can sleep. When the campfire is full, you are safe for the night and you can rest. If the fire dies before then, you are not. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635560/extras/c0e1fba5dfc58f63bd1b2c415aa0e74b.poster.avif?t=1785681581\" width=1078 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635560/extras/c0e1fba5dfc58f63bd1b2c415aa0e74b.webm?t=1785681581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4635560/extras/c0e1fba5dfc58f63bd1b2c415aa0e74b.mp4?t=1785681581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't Panic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is moving between the trees. You may hear it before you see it. You may see it too late. You may think you have enough time for one more log.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You probably do not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "A co-op game where you are camping in the woods, enjoying the night when you hear a walkie buzzing. A emergency broadcast warns campers in the area: something is in the forest and you are not alone. Feed your campfire or you will become the food.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>langu